    "notes": "WBTC confirms AC-24 Patuli → Howrah and the ordered corridor Ruby → Gariahat → Hazra → Exide → Park Street → Esplanade. A user-provided map image confirms the visible Ruby → Park Street alignment: west from Ruby through Gariahat and Deshapriya Park to Hazra, then north past Exide toward Park Street. Its pixels were not copied as coordinates. OSM pedestrian topology is used for the central line because ordinary car routing follows one-way detours that do not match the supplied bus-route reference. Patuli → Ruby and Park Street → Howrah were cropped from the image and remain provisional OSM-routed sections. Exact kerbsides, the full northern section and the reverse direction still require more route images or a GPS/GPX trace."
